    "chunk_text": "Vesting a plot of Land with the University of Colombo for residential requirements of the Faculty of Indigenous Medicine\n\nPress briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-07-22 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)\n\n- A land in extent of about 0.1765 hectares belonging to the Department of Irrigation and along with the buildings located therein have been vested with the then Ministry of Higher Education, with the approval of the Cabinet, on 50 years lease basis for the hostel requirement of female students studying in the Institute of Indigenous Medicine. By the Gazette Extraordinary Notification dated 2023\u201102\u201113, the Institute of Indigenous Medicine has been transformed into a Faculty of the University of Colombo and the said Faculty has decided to utilize the aforementioned land to be utilized for the hostel requirement of  female students. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Minister of Education to vest the plot of land located at No.330, Dr. N.M. Perera Mawatha, Colombo 08 with the University of Colombo, enabling to utilize the said land for the hostel requirement of the female students of the said Faculty, was approved by the Cabinet."
