    "chunk_text": "Providing relief to the communities who are affected by the flood situation\tin Kolonnawa area\n\nPress briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2024-06-03 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)\n\n- The Hon. President has paid a visit to Kolonnawa area during the afternoon on 2024-06-03 to observe the situation faced by the people in Kolonnawa due to the heavy rain in the last few days. Taking into account the matters submitted by the communities of the region during the visit, the approval has been granted for the following proposals made by the Hon. President.\n\n*\tProviding food and other essential services to the people who are  affected by the floods in Kolonnawa area as well as to the people who are affected in other parts of the country.\n\n*\tRemoval of illegal constructions that have caused flooding in the Divisional Secretariat Division, Kolonnawa, suspension of land filling activities and repairing the drainage systems of the area and taking other relevant measures.\n\n* \tTo appoint a committee chaired by the District Secretary of Colombo with the representatives from the relevant institutions to identify the possible root causes of the floods in the area and recommend measures to be taken to avoid such recurrences in future and to prepare a comprehensive development plan for the re-planning of the city of Kolonnawa by utilizing the available land within the territory of the Divisional Secretariat Division, Kolonnawa in the most productive manner."
